{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026oAWHiJNIpj1794218825.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>鼎爺教煮琵琶豆腐，煮出不一樣的惹味豆腐。鼎爺曾教怎樣煮出琵琶豆腐，不過為了口感更好，鼎爺決定將兩份豆腐變成「外脆內軟」與「外軟內脆」。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"86ec7830-4527-4b3e-ab92-7addf2eceea7.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026d5Ili1oJEy1794218954.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"38af8388-1e12-4395-830e-6da905f22492.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026OfDr4iE8X41794218829.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p></p><h3>琵琶豆腐材料</h3><ul><li><p>生根</p></li><li><p>碎豬肉</p></li><li><p>韭菜</p></li><li><p>蝦米</p></li><li><p>鮫魚鹹魚</p></li><li><p>硬豆腐</p></li></ul><h3>琵琶豆腐做法</h3><ol><li><p>切碎蝦米備用；鹹魚蒸熟後去皮，切成蓉，備用；生根汆水備用。</p></li><li><p>碎豬肉、碎蝦米、鹹魚蓉、糖、豆粉、食油、硬豆腐拌勻，成混合物。</p></li><li><p>不銹鋼菜碟上沾滿油，把豆腐混合物鋪平，蒸13至15分鐘。</p></li><li><p>一半混合物煎香後釀進生根中，用韭菜綁實，再蒸6至7分鐘。</p></li><li><p>另一半混合物釀入生根內，用生粉黏著封口，用油炸至變金黃色。</p></li><li><p>用蠔油、豆粉、糖煮成醬汁，淋在琵琶豆腐上，完成！</p></li></ol><p><p><img alt=\"339ac46a-75e9-4453-9b0d-d99b7a959a4b.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026z0XTsJHGaY1794218834.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T02:10:30.358947+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":278,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T01:04:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T06:47:22.969842+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T02:03:54.586700+00:00","content_hash":"8590623b6e86b49a01a32d691870e81f910c2aca9bb4401c0cbb3103f8203391","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}